          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Clinically validated technology</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Proprietary electrode technology and <a href=\"https://heartsinelive.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2015/06/H009-020-003-AJ_Scope_TechNote_EN-US_0621_web.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SCOPE biphasic technology</a> automatically adjust for differences in patient response to intervention.</span></span></p>\n",
