          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Simple, user-friendly operation</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Easy-to-understand&nbsp;visual and voice prompts guide the rescuer&nbsp;through the entire resuscitation process, including CPR—a key link in the chain of survival.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Simple, straightforward operation with just an on/off button (and a shock button on the HeartSine samaritan PAD 350P).</span></span></p>\n",
