          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Self-monitoring AED program</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifelink-central.html\" target=\"_self\">LIFELINKcentral AED program manager</a> monitors each HeartSine AED connected to a Wi-Fi network and automatically alerts you to anything that may affect device readiness - reducing the effort and expense of managing your AED program, while increasing your program’s readiness and effectiveness.</span></span></p>\n",
